{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "xrxk7ydqinuept5u", "title": "14.HuggingFace 核心组件及应用实战", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u9734fd4b\" id=\"u9734fd4b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4500da3\" id=\"uf4500da3\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b0c1578\" id=\"u0b0c1578\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F1387387%2F1745159933986-689f23fc-72f1-4a7a-91b4-8c48091012c7.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22huggingface-app.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A6895%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u38710337-f78c-4eda-9d33-ec4cb4ac00d%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua6b90d87%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2a34d5f0\" id=\"u2a34d5f0\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9eed3d13\" id=\"u9eed3d13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9d0f9788\" id=\"u9d0f9788\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b6ccf17\" id=\"u5b6ccf17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">python版本：3.11.7</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2c32c063\" id=\"u2c32c063\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u64cce907\" id=\"u64cce907\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u02c218a8\" id=\"u02c218a8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u78183b03\" id=\"u78183b03\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">分享内容</span></strong></p><ol list=\"u1b41aeaf\"><li fid=\"u1b68fff7\" data-lake-id=\"u2beb8bb9\" id=\"u2beb8bb9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue378367f\" id=\"ue378367f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">什么是 Hugging Face？它的目标是什么？</span></li><li fid=\"u1b68fff7\" data-lake-id=\"u66019112\" id=\"u66019112\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufd7a7fc0\" id=\"ufd7a7fc0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Hugging Face 中包含哪些知名的预训练模型?</span></li><li fid=\"u1b68fff7\" data-lake-id=\"ub34d3a3d\" id=\"ub34d3a3d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9258bdc\" id=\"uc9258bdc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如果我们要在 Hugging Face 中下载 BERT，那么</span></li></ol><ol list=\"u1b41aeaf\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ue0b7ac00\" data-lake-id=\"u530d9785\" id=\"u530d9785\"><span data-lake-id=\"u394853ec\" id=\"u394853ec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">只有一种版本，还是有多种版本可以选择？</span></li><li fid=\"ue0b7ac00\" data-lake-id=\"u36337e26\" id=\"u36337e26\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub97fb88e\" id=\"ub97fb88e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">每一种版本的 BERT 中，只有一种格式还是有多种格式可以适应多种下游任务？</span></li></ol><ol list=\"u1b41aeaf\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u1b68fff7\" data-lake-id=\"u97500a8f\" id=\"u97500a8f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0b3d6ac\" id=\"ub0b3d6ac\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Hugging Face 库中有哪些有用的组件？</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"dbcff39f\" id=\"dbcff39f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb06e95c\" id=\"ufb06e95c\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">一、Hugging Face 简介</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u60bbe646\" id=\"u60bbe646\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf29568b1\" id=\"uf29568b1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">官网：</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u083dd868\" id=\"u083dd868\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf47a95ef\" id=\"uf47a95ef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">https://huggingface.co/</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u09e08e04\" id=\"u09e08e04\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4006c82\" id=\"uc4006c82\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Hugging Face 是一个开源的 AI 社区网站，站内几乎囊括了所有常见的 AI 开源模型，号称：一网打尽，应有尽有，全部开源。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8d28cfa9\" id=\"u8d28cfa9\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1736329281540-79e3d7dd-7330-45da-bedb-b8a5988019b6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf0d908ea-2984-4602-9739-efceda52d17%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubfd939b2-0987-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1280%2C%22originHeight%22%3A934%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.6500000953674316%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b7c3c0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uef014a49%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u36196486\" id=\"u36196486\"><span data-lake-id=\"u66c4c598\" id=\"u66c4c598\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">在 Hugging Face 中可以下载到众多开源的预训练大模型，模型本身包含相关信息和参数，可以拿来做微调和重新训练，非常方便。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u71b9e944\" id=\"u71b9e944\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1736329281532-d5807167-9ab1-4fdb-ade0-e32f9ec26c79.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua82a1cee-1cfc-485f-8a90-d0a8e04589e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubfd939b2-0987-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1280%2C%22originHeight%22%3A358%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.6500000953674316%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbfaf7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud46cb3bf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"7ad7cd06\" id=\"7ad7cd06\"><span data-lake-id=\"udb972d47\" id=\"udb972d47\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">二、Hugging Face 核心组件</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u95468707\" id=\"u95468707\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1736329281595-47360d0f-4018-4626-a02e-cc7bcd73e8af.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u863b4dd4-a0e8-43a1-836a-285f7983823%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubfd939b2-0987-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A402.7783966064453%2C%22height%22%3A408%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A815%2C%22originHeight%22%3A825%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.6500000953674316%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbf5e6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u17a6e98c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3e1e2e2b\" id=\"u3e1e2e2b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc77a7bc\" id=\"ufc77a7bc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Hugging Face 核心组件包括 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u748663d1\" id=\"u748663d1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Transformers、Dataset、Tokenizer</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue40ff889\" id=\"ue40ff889\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">，此外还有一些辅助工具，如 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0bf8fa25\" id=\"u0bf8fa25\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Accelerate</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubbe51fae\" id=\"ubbe51fae\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">，用于加速深度学习训练过程。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u17b9012b\" id=\"u17b9012b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf9d0a09c\" id=\"uf9d0a09c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119)\">更多内容可以去 Hugging Face 官网上发掘，下面重点介绍下它的三个核心组件。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"41819a5f\" id=\"41819a5f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u42ec8c48\" id=\"u42ec8c48\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">1、Hugging Face Transformers</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u80a69611\" id=\"u80a69611\"><span data-lake-id=\"u562f69af\" id=\"u562f69af\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Transformers 是 Hugging Face 的核心组件，主要用于自然语言处理，提供了预训练的语言模型和相关工具，使得研究者和工程师能够轻松的训练和使用海量的 NLP 模型。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u89a5b2f2\" id=\"u89a5b2f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u59478aef\" id=\"u59478aef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">常用的模型包括 BERT、GPT、XLNet、RoBERTa 等，并提供了模型的各种版本。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ude88c6cb\" id=\"ude88c6cb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u165daf3d\" id=\"u165daf3d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">通过 Transformers 库，开发人员可以用这些预训练模型进行文本分类、命名实体识别、机器翻译、问答系统等 NLP 任务。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc860276f\" id=\"uc860276f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubfb7d2fc\" id=\"ubfb7d2fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Transformers 库本身还提供方便的 API、实例代码、文档，让开发者学习和使用这些模型都变得非常简单，同时开发者也可以上传自己的预训练模型和 API。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E9%A6%96%E5%85%88%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%20pip%20%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E5%BA%93%EF%BC%9Apip%20install%20transformers%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%20transformers%20%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E5%BA%93%5Cnfrom%20transformers%20import%20AutoModelForSequenceClassification%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%88%86%E8%AF%8D%E5%99%A8%E5%92%8C%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%5Cnmodel_name%20%3D%20%5C%22bert-base-cased%5C%22%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(model_name%2C%20num_labels%3D2)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%B0%86%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%A0%E9%87%8F%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%5Cnoutputs%20%3D%20model(**inputs)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%92%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%5Cnpredictions%20%3D%20outputs.logits.argmax(dim%3D-1)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uJ8Ur%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"d21210b7\" id=\"d21210b7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2a410de\" id=\"ub2a410de\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">2、Hugging Face Dataset</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u8d858001\" id=\"u8d858001\"><span data-lake-id=\"u756015db\" id=\"u756015db\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Dataset 是 Hugging Face 的公共数据集仓库，以下是常用的一些数据集（欢迎补充）：</span></p><ol list=\"u9e354c8d\"><li fid=\"uf808d33f\" data-lake-id=\"u7407fe92\" id=\"u7407fe92\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube082113\" id=\"ube082113\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">SQuAD：Stanford 大学发布的问答数据集</span></li><li fid=\"uf808d33f\" data-lake-id=\"uee6513fe\" id=\"uee6513fe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3da20441\" id=\"u3da20441\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">IMBDB：电影评论数据集</span></li><li fid=\"uf808d33f\" data-lake-id=\"u8e29b5ab\" id=\"u8e29b5ab\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc5ca20a7\" id=\"uc5ca20a7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">CoNLL-2003：NER 命名实体识别数据集</span></li><li fid=\"uf808d33f\" data-lake-id=\"u64f3a8d6\" id=\"u64f3a8d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4457b2d5\" id=\"u4457b2d5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">GLUE：公共基准测试集</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u136324d9\" id=\"u136324d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub8f13531\" id=\"ub8f13531\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Hugging Face Dataset 简化了数据集的下载、预处理过程，并具备数据集分割、采样和迭代器等功能。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E9%A6%96%E5%85%88%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%20pip%20%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E5%BA%93%EF%BC%9Apip%20install%20datasets%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%9B%86%5Cnfrom%20datasets%20import%20load_dataset%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%9B%86%E5%B9%B6%E6%89%93%E4%B9%B1%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cndataset_name%20%3D%20%5C%22imdb%5C%22%5Cndataset%20%3D%20load_dataset(dataset_name)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R1oqh%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"2d96453a\" id=\"2d96453a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2c998167\" id=\"u2c998167\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">3、Hugging Face Tokenizer</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u54309dcd\" id=\"u54309dcd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub5c734e2\" id=\"ub5c734e2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Tokenizer 是 Hugging Face 的分词器，它的任务是将输入文本转换为一个个标记（tokens），它还能对文本序列进行清洗、截断和填充等预处理，以满足模型的输入要求。</span><span data-lake-id=\"u11612213\" id=\"u11612213\">它的主要功能是将文本分解为更小的单元（通常是词或子词），并将这些单元映射到数值表示。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf80c8ada\" id=\"uf80c8ada\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2e6bb30\" id=\"ua2e6bb30\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">以下是分词器的简单解释：</span></p><ol list=\"u81489398\"><li fid=\"u9c06a259\" data-lake-id=\"ud0fbf347\" id=\"ud0fbf347\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9b67b48e\" id=\"u9b67b48e\">文本分割</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufc7a05b7\" id=\"ufc7a05b7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：分词器首先将输入的文本分割成更小的单元。例如，对于句子 &quot;I love NLP&quot;，分词器可能会将其分割为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u28256884\" id=\"u28256884\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd7af7ff\" id=\"udd7af7ff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">[&quot;I&quot;, &quot;love&quot;, &quot;NLP&quot;]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u027d19b1\" id=\"u027d19b1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u9c06a259\" data-lake-id=\"ub9e4eb50\" id=\"ub9e4eb50\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf1846f4d\" id=\"uf1846f4d\">词汇映射</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucc5341f2\" id=\"ucc5341f2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：分词器会将每个单元映射到一个唯一的数值索引，这些索引通常来自一个预定义的词汇表。例如，假设词汇表中 &quot;I&quot; 的索引是 1，&quot;love&quot; 的索引是 2，&quot;NLP&quot; 的索引是 3，那么分词器会将句子转换为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9949e999\" id=\"u9949e999\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a68208f\" id=\"u7a68208f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">[1, 2, 3]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufd78cec4\" id=\"ufd78cec4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u9c06a259\" data-lake-id=\"u5e4ee65c\" id=\"u5e4ee65c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u85f78224\" id=\"u85f78224\">处理特殊标记</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4829ed1a\" id=\"u4829ed1a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：分词器还会处理一些特殊的标记，比如句子开头的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc45e483a\" id=\"uc45e483a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u992169d0\" id=\"u992169d0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">[CLS]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u67442635\" id=\"u67442635\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 标记和句子结尾的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u1c76a3e3\" id=\"u1c76a3e3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a2fb2aa\" id=\"u1a2fb2aa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">[SEP]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9e5a315e\" id=\"u9e5a315e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 标记，这些标记在某些模型中是必需的。</span></li><li fid=\"u9c06a259\" data-lake-id=\"uaf286b22\" id=\"uaf286b22\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u75e7d4cc\" id=\"u75e7d4cc\">填充和截断</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud32a21b4\" id=\"ud32a21b4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：为了使输入的长度一致，分词器可以对较短的序列进行填充（添加特殊的填充标记）或对较长的序列进行截断。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u7a7f6009\" id=\"u7a7f6009\"><span data-lake-id=\"u32488705\" id=\"u32488705\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">通过这些步骤，分词器将文本转换为模型可以理解的数值格式，使得模型能够进行进一步的处理和预测。希望这个解释能帮助你理解分词器的作用！</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E9%A6%96%E5%85%88%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%20pip%20%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E5%BA%93%EF%BC%9Apip%20install%20transformers%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E5%88%86%E8%AF%8D%E5%99%A8%5Cnfrom%20transformers%20import%20AutoTokenizer%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%88%86%E8%AF%8D%E5%99%A8%E5%92%8C%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%B0%86%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E4%B8%BA%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%9C%9F%E6%9C%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%A0%E9%87%8F%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%5Cninputs%20%3D%20tokenizer(dataset%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D%5B%5C%22text%5C%22%5D%5B%3A10%5D%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20padding%3DTrue%2C%20truncation%3DTrue%2C%20return_tensors%3D%5C%22pt%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VDxET%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9a7f3c81\" id=\"u9a7f3c81\"><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"aabvG\" id=\"aabvG\"><span data-lake-id=\"uafe03684\" id=\"uafe03684\">张量概念</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u1c72d793\" id=\"u1c72d793\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1de2042\" id=\"ua1de2042\">在机器学习和深度学习中，&quot;张量&quot;（Tensor）是一个多维数组的通用术语。它是数据的基本结构，类似于标量、向量和矩阵，但可以扩展到更高的维度。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6f27f4aa\" id=\"u6f27f4aa\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc3e8d582\" id=\"uc3e8d582\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">以下是张量的简单解释：</span></p><ol list=\"ubfd0803c\"><li fid=\"u9f0dc23d\" data-lake-id=\"u5317ed78\" id=\"u5317ed78\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u085e69f0\" id=\"u085e69f0\">标量（0维张量）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u48364990\" id=\"u48364990\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：一个单一的数值。例如，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u592cf5ce\" id=\"u592cf5ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4448b25a\" id=\"u4448b25a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">3</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u968bb377\" id=\"u968bb377\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 或 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u0ab89d37\" id=\"u0ab89d37\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua57765be\" id=\"ua57765be\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">-1.5</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u799b0c98\" id=\"u799b0c98\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u9f0dc23d\" data-lake-id=\"u06e773cb\" id=\"u06e773cb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9a0565e5\" id=\"u9a0565e5\">向量（1维张量）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub532f32e\" id=\"ub532f32e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：一组有序的数值。例如，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u9a19b7b3\" id=\"u9a19b7b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4e428ed9\" id=\"u4e428ed9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">[1, 2, 3]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc1a0d714\" id=\"uc1a0d714\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u9f0dc23d\" data-lake-id=\"uca710205\" id=\"uca710205\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u266dd93b\" id=\"u266dd93b\">矩阵（2维张量）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua10e0451\" id=\"ua10e0451\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：一个二维数组。例如：</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5B1%2C%202%2C%203%5D%2C%5Cn%20%5B4%2C%205%2C%206%5D%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GBf5S%22%7D\"></card><ol list=\"ubfd0803c\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u9f0dc23d\" data-lake-id=\"u842690d0\" id=\"u842690d0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u909f04b8\" id=\"u909f04b8\">高维张量（3维及以上）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4ad58636\" id=\"u4ad58636\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：可以想象成多层的矩阵。例如，一个3维张量可以是一个矩阵的集合。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u91e249df\" id=\"u91e249df\"><span data-lake-id=\"u162f6462\" id=\"u162f6462\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在你的代码中，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u9d1e530e\" id=\"u9d1e530e\"><span data-lake-id=\"udfc516e6\" id=\"udfc516e6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">inputs</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u500098e1\" id=\"u500098e1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 是一个张量，它是通过分词器将文本数据转换为模型可以理解的格式。这个张量通常是一个二维的，形状为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc43aa0ec\" id=\"uc43aa0ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua20c135f\" id=\"ua20c135f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">[batch_size, sequence_length]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ude95e679\" id=\"ude95e679\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">，其中 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u84145e49\" id=\"u84145e49\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf11d42c5\" id=\"uf11d42c5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">batch_size</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua7222df5\" id=\"ua7222df5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 是批处理的样本数量，</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub9623170\" id=\"ub9623170\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua3a69266\" id=\"ua3a69266\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">sequence_length</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue8b7ca48\" id=\"ue8b7ca48\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 是每个样本的最大长度。这个张量包含了文本的数值化表示，通常是词汇表中每个词的索引。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6e80c4a0\" id=\"u6e80c4a0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1125ee92\" id=\"u1125ee92\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">通过这种方式，模型可以处理文本数据并进行预测。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaaf3a641\" id=\"uaaf3a641\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0e76380\" id=\"ub0e76380\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">​</span><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"XSxE8\" id=\"XSxE8\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd73c07c\" id=\"udd73c07c\" style=\"color: inherit\">[CLS]</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6cbbe25e\" id=\"u6cbbe25e\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(243, 243, 243)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u7c88fb1c\" id=\"u7c88fb1c\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">[SEP]标记作用</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ucfb3ae0c\" id=\"ucfb3ae0c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc5b8aa0d\" id=\"uc5b8aa0d\">在一些自然语言处理模型（如BERT）中，特殊标记 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u1c100884\" id=\"u1c100884\"><span data-lake-id=\"u53800ed6\" id=\"u53800ed6\">[CLS]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua6adf8d5\" id=\"ua6adf8d5\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ufa71db79\" id=\"ufa71db79\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c22285d\" id=\"u5c22285d\">[SEP]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uad80f259\" id=\"uad80f259\"> 被用来帮助模型理解输入的结构和上下文。以下是它们的作用和简单解释：</span></p><ol list=\"u490be47f\"><li fid=\"uc254bc1c\" data-lake-id=\"u18651da1\" id=\"u18651da1\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc4d81c02\" id=\"uc4d81c02\"><span data-lake-id=\"udb858735\" id=\"udb858735\">[CLS]</span></code><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubb444b2d\" id=\"ubb444b2d\"> 标记</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9500959a\" id=\"u9500959a\">：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u57864862\" id=\"u57864862\" style=\"padding-left: 4em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u424aff07\" id=\"u424aff07\">[CLS] 的英文全称是 &quot;Classification&quot;。在中文中，它通常被翻译为“分类”。这个标记在模型中用于表示整个输入序列的聚合信息，特别是在分类任务中。</span></p><ul list=\"u490be47f\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uc254bc1c\" data-lake-id=\"u7482e144\" id=\"u7482e144\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubee0cb3e\" id=\"ubee0cb3e\">作用</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5d99c187\" id=\"u5d99c187\">：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub4d6df66\" id=\"ub4d6df66\"><span data-lake-id=\"u78b72421\" id=\"u78b72421\">[CLS]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u134e5151\" id=\"u134e5151\"> 标记通常放在输入序列的开头，用于表示整个序列的聚合信息。对于分类任务，模型会使用与 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u51c930fb\" id=\"u51c930fb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda862ba9\" id=\"uda862ba9\">[CLS]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0ed59313\" id=\"u0ed59313\"> 标记对应的输出向量来进行最终的分类。</span></li><li fid=\"uc254bc1c\" data-lake-id=\"ub4a8d04f\" id=\"ub4a8d04f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u114f7487\" id=\"u114f7487\">例子</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u74e4b8af\" id=\"u74e4b8af\">：假设你有一个句子 &quot;I love NLP&quot;，在输入到模型之前，分词器会将其转换为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub508437d\" id=\"ub508437d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9907ae13\" id=\"u9907ae13\">[&quot;[CLS]&quot;, &quot;I&quot;, &quot;love&quot;, &quot;NLP&quot;]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8456205f\" id=\"u8456205f\">。模型会特别关注 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u175213e1\" id=\"u175213e1\"><span data-lake-id=\"udae5784a\" id=\"udae5784a\">[CLS]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u67586735\" id=\"u67586735\"> 的输出，因为它代表了整个句子的语义。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u490be47f\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uc254bc1c\" data-lake-id=\"u8081a1fc\" id=\"u8081a1fc\"><code data-lake-id=\"u142c2b59\" id=\"u142c2b59\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud483e805\" id=\"ud483e805\">[SEP]</span></code><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0e802129\" id=\"u0e802129\"> 标记</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1521aec2\" id=\"u1521aec2\">：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uf6fe559c\" id=\"uf6fe559c\" style=\"padding-left: 4em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07aa3308\" id=\"u07aa3308\">[SEP] 的英文全称是 &quot;Separator&quot;。在中文中，它通常被翻译为“分隔符”。这个标记用于分隔不同的句子或段落，帮助模型理解句子之间的边界。</span></p><ul list=\"u490be47f\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ub1e72b34\" data-lake-id=\"uab0070ea\" id=\"uab0070ea\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2719d8a0\" id=\"u2719d8a0\">作用</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4bb995c5\" id=\"u4bb995c5\">：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u9069f649\" id=\"u9069f649\"><span data-lake-id=\"u85747e64\" id=\"u85747e64\">[SEP]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u715beee6\" id=\"u715beee6\"> 标记用于分隔不同的句子或段落，帮助模型理解句子之间的边界。在句子对任务（如问答或句子对分类）中，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u9b821ebd\" id=\"u9b821ebd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd187e7e\" id=\"ucd187e7e\">[SEP]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3dd4d93c\" id=\"u3dd4d93c\"> 标记用于分隔两个句子。</span></li><li fid=\"ub1e72b34\" data-lake-id=\"u40d94920\" id=\"u40d94920\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3f60fc88\" id=\"u3f60fc88\">例子</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5144c735\" id=\"u5144c735\">：如果你有两个句子 &quot;I love NLP&quot; 和 &quot;It is fascinating&quot;，在输入到模型之前，分词器会将其转换为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uec75e86f\" id=\"uec75e86f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3cc4d00b\" id=\"u3cc4d00b\">[&quot;[CLS]&quot;, &quot;I&quot;, &quot;love&quot;, &quot;NLP&quot;, &quot;[SEP]&quot;, &quot;It&quot;, &quot;is&quot;, &quot;fascinating&quot;, &quot;[SEP]&quot;]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u84ac30a7\" id=\"u84ac30a7\">。这样，模型就能识别出两个句子之间的分界。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"uc4a13b00\" id=\"uc4a13b00\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45dbabef\" id=\"u45dbabef\">通过使用这些特殊标记，模型能够更好地理解输入的结构和上下文，从而提高处理和预测的准确性。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"00165c86\" id=\"00165c86\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b567925\" id=\"u7b567925\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">三、Hugging Face 应用实战</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u23be394c\" id=\"u23be394c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub28c7371\" id=\"ub28c7371\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">该应用实战是通过 Hugging Face Transformers 完成一个很简单的文本分类任务（预测影评是正面还是负面），完整代码如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%201.%20%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%93%5Cnfrom%20transformers%20import%20AutoTokenizer%2C%20AutoModelForSequenceClassification%5Cnfrom%20datasets%20import%20load_dataset%5Cn%5Cn%23%202.%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%9B%86%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0%E5%92%8C%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%20imdb%20%E5%BD%B1%E8%AF%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%9B%86%5Cndataset_name%20%3D%20%5C%22imdb%5C%22%5Cntask%20%3D%20%5C%22sentiment-analysis%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%23%203.%20%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%9B%86%E5%B9%B6%E6%89%93%E4%B9%B1%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cndataset%20%3D%20load_dataset(dataset_name)%5Cndataset%20%3D%20dataset.shuffle()%5Cn%5Cn%23%204.%20%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%88%86%E8%AF%8D%E5%99%A8%E5%92%8C%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%5Cnmodel_name%20%3D%20%5C%22bert-base-cased%5C%22%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(model_name%2C%20num_labels%3D2)%5Cn%5Cn%23%205.%20%E5%B0%86%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E4%B8%BA%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%9C%9F%E6%9C%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%A0%E9%87%8F%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%5Cninputs%20%3D%20tokenizer(dataset%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D%5B%5C%22text%5C%22%5D%5B%3A10%5D%2C%20padding%3DTrue%2C%20truncation%3DTrue%2C%20return_tensors%3D%5C%22pt%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%23%206.%20%E5%B0%86%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%A0%E9%87%8F%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%5Cnoutputs%20%3D%20model(**inputs)%5Cn%5Cn%23%207.%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%92%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%5Cnpredictions%20%3D%20outputs.logits.argmax(dim%3D-1)%5Cnlabels%20%3D%20dataset%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D%5B%5C%22label%5C%22%5D%5B%3A10%5D%5Cn%5Cn%23%208.%20%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%92%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%5Cnfor%20i%2C%20(prediction%2C%20label)%20in%20enumerate(zip(predictions%2C%20labels))%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20prediction_label%20%3D%20%5C%22%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%5C%22%20if%20prediction%20%3D%3D%201%20else%20%5C%22%E8%B4%9F%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20true_label%20%3D%20%5C%22%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%5C%22%20if%20label%20%3D%3D%201%20else%20%5C%22%E8%B4%9F%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22Example%20%7Bi%2B1%7D%3A%20Prediction%3A%20%7Bprediction_label%7D%2C%20True%20label%3A%20%7Btrue_label%7D%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iE0TV%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4e8d7004\" id=\"u4e8d7004\"><span data-lake-id=\"u433d138e\" id=\"u433d138e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">注意：要运行代码，需要安装最新的 pytorch 、transformers 和 datasets。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u465ce8cd\" id=\"u465ce8cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c13219d\" id=\"u5c13219d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">将代码文件保存为：huggingface.py，运行后结果如下（第一次运行需要从 Hugging Face 上下载数据集和模型，需要一点时间）：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22C%3A%5C%5CUsers%5C%5CLenovo%5C%5Canaconda3%5C%5Cenvs%5C%5Cpytorch211%5C%5Cpython.exe%20%5C%22huggingface.py%5C%22%5CnDownloading%20readme%3A%20100%25%7C%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%7C%207.81k%2F7.81k%20%5B00%3A00%3C%3F%2C%20%3FB%2Fs%5D%5CnDownloading%20data%3A%20100%25%7C%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%7C%2021.0M%2F21.0M%20%5B00%3A27%3C00%3A00%2C%20753kB%2Fs%5D%5CnDownloading%20data%3A%20100%25%7C%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%7C%2020.5M%2F20.5M%20%5B00%3A07%3C00%3A00%2C%202.88MB%2Fs%5D%5CnDownloading%20data%3A%20100%25%7C%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%7C%2042.0M%2F42.0M%20%5B00%3A08%3C00%3A00%2C%205.13MB%2Fs%5D%5CnGenerating%20train%20split%3A%20100%25%7C%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%7C%2025000%2F25000%20%5B00%3A00%3C00%3A00%2C%20347815.24%20examples%2Fs%5D%5CnGenerating%20test%20split%3A%20100%25%7C%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%7C%2025000%2F25000%20%5B00%3A00%3C00%3A00%2C%20481791.57%20examples%2Fs%5D%5CnGenerating%20unsupervised%20split%3A%20100%25%7C%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%E2%96%88%7C%2050000%2F50000%20%5B00%3A00%3C00%3A00%2C%20450755.18%20examples%2Fs%5D%5CnC%3A%5C%5CUsers%5C%5CLenovo%5C%5Canaconda3%5C%5Cenvs%5C%5Cpytorch211%5C%5CLib%5C%5Csite-packages%5C%5Chuggingface_hub%5C%5Cfile_download.py%3A149%3A%20UserWarning%3A%20%60huggingface_hub%60%20cache-system%20uses%20symlinks%20by%20default%20to%20efficiently%20store%20duplicated%20files%20but%20your%20machine%20does%20not%20support%20them%20in%20C%3A%5C%5CUsers%5C%5CLenovo%5C%5C.cache%5C%5Chuggingface%5C%5Chub%5C%5Cmodels--bert-base-cased.%20Caching%20files%20will%20still%20work%20but%20in%20a%20degraded%20version%20that%20might%20require%20more%20space%20on%20your%20disk.%20This%20warning%20can%20be%20disabled%20by%20setting%20the%20%60HF_HUB_DISABLE_SYMLINKS_WARNING%60%20environment%20variable.%20For%20more%20details%2C%20see%20https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdocs%2Fhuggingface_hub%2Fhow-to-cache%23limitations.%5CnTo%20support%20symlinks%20on%20Windows%2C%20you%20either%20need%20to%20activate%20Developer%20Mode%20or%20to%20run%20Python%20as%20an%20administrator.%20In%20order%20to%20see%20activate%20developer%20mode%2C%20see%20this%20article%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fwindows%2Fapps%2Fget-started%2Fenable-your-device-for-development%5Cn%20%20warnings.warn(message)%5CnSome%20weights%20of%20BertForSequenceClassification%20were%20not%20initialized%20f